      "validation": "Before–after–after–before–before–after; 3 original benchmark suites per version; median of report medians.",
      "evidence_type": "Unprofiled original benchmarks",
      "status": "Improved"
    },
    {
      "title": "GET response conversion",
      "evidence": "100 KB: 6,157 → 0 calls · 0.314 → 0.181 CPU s",
      "interpretation": "The recursive jsonable_encoder pass is eliminated. GET first-request profiled CPU is 42.3% lower at 100 KB and 8.4% lower at 10 KB; HTTP JSON serialization still occurs once.",
      "optimization": "Direct GET response encoding",
      "validation": "Call counts verified in all 3 cold captures per GET shape; first-request CPU medians are from 3 processes per version.",
      "evidence_type": "Cold Yappi CPU profiles",
      "status": "Observed"
    },
    {
      "title": "Small GET and POST controls",
      "evidence": "GET 10 KB: 40.9 → 41.0 ms · no demonstrated gain",
